# No *.db.gz glob on purpose: a *.db.gz + !-negation did not take effect
# (2026-09-27: the file 404'd, failover never engaged, API stayed db:down).
# The merged-DB failover dumps (101MB+, past Vercel's 100MB per-file limit)
# are served from public R2 instead — the HF backend downloads them from
# there for SQLite failover while Neon is down (see backend/db/sqlite_failover.py).
# Explicit paths so Vercel CLI deploys never attempt these files again.
/public/snapshots/latest/merged-motormila.db.gz
/public/snapshots/latest/merged-autolens.db.gz
*.log
.pytest_cache/
/android/
